{
  "name": "Summarize an RSS feed into a daily digest with Google Gemini",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "b8e75d2d-0169-49b7-863b-2addec14bcca",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -800,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 1,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 852,
        "content": "## Summarize an RSS feed into a daily digest with Google Gemini\n\n### Who is this for\nAnyone who follows a blog, news feed or changelog and would rather read five bullets than twenty articles. Works well for teams who want a shared morning briefing in Slack, Discord or Telegram.\n\n### What this workflow does\nOnce a day it fetches an RSS feed or web page, sends the text to Google Gemini, and gets back a digest of up to five short bullets. The digest is posted as JSON (`{ \"text\": \"...\" }`) to any webhook you choose.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Get a free Gemini API key from Google AI Studio.\n2. Create a Query Auth credential with name `key` and your API key as the value, then select it on the Gemini node.\n3. Open **Configure (edit me)** and set your feed URL and destination webhook.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Requirements\n- A Google Gemini API key (the free tier is enough)\n- A webhook to receive the digest (a Slack, Discord or Telegram incoming webhook, or your own endpoint)\n\n### How to customize\nEdit the prompt on the Gemini node to change the length, tone or language. Change the schedule node for a different time or frequency. The Gemini call retries up to five times if the API is briefly overloaded.\n\nMore ready-made AI workflows: https://ruancody.gumroad.com/l/vlbne"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "50ce5b38-7a6c-4fd7-b8de-22fbbfeb5a2f",
      "name": "Section fetch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -260,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Fetch\nSchedule plus your settings, then pull the feed as text."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "aff351a0-e8ed-4a41-a74f-1cb3e9403b95",
      "name": "Section summarize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        420,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Summarize and send\nGemini writes the digest, which is posted to your webhook."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "config-1",
      "name": "Configure (edit me)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        20,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "sourceUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://n8n.io/blog/rss/"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "notifyWebhookUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://webhook.site/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DESTINATION"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "fetch-1",
      "name": "Fetch Source",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.sourceUrl }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-summarize-1",
      "name": "AI Summarize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "maxTries": 5,
      "position": [
        460,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-3.6-flash:generateContent",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ contents: [ { parts: [ { text: \"Summarize the following content into a short, punchy daily digest (max 5 bullet points, plain text, no markdown):\\n\\n\" + $json.data.slice(0, 8000) } ] } ] }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpQueryAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpQueryAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gemini API Key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "format-1",
      "name": "Format Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "digest",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "notify-1",
      "name": "Send Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Configure (edit me)').item.json.notifyWebhookUrl }}",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: $json.digest }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "AI Summarize": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Output",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch Source": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Summarize",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Output": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Notification",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Daily Schedule": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Configure (edit me)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Configure (edit me)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch Source",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}